# Vault path map & key bundles

Used by seed/export scripts and GitHub Actions.

## Stages

| Stage arg | KV prefix |
|---|---|
| `prod` | `checkout/prod` |
| `dev` | `checkout/dev` |
| `feature` | `checkout/feature` |
| any `fb-*` slug | `checkout/feature` (shared feature bundle) |

## Bundles (KV v2 mount `secret`)

### `payment`

| Field | Env |
|---|---|
| `api_url` | `PAYMENT_API_URL` |
| `public_key` | `PAYMENT_PUBLIC_KEY` |
| `private_key` | `PAYMENT_PRIVATE_KEY` |
| `integrity_key` | `PAYMENT_INTEGRITY_KEY` |
| `events_key` | `PAYMENT_EVENTS_KEY` |
| `currency` | `PAYMENT_CURRENCY` |

### `aws` (optional — CI may still use GH secrets / OIDC)

| Field | Env |
|---|---|
| `access_key_id` | `AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID` |
| `secret_access_key` | `AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY` |

### `app`

| Field | Env |
|---|---|
| `payment_gateway_mode` | `PAYMENT_GATEWAY_MODE` |
| `cors_origin` | `CORS_ORIGIN` |
| `base_fee` | `BASE_FEE` |
| `delivery_fee` | `DELIVERY_FEE` |
